    "detailed_description": "Join Ellen in her quest to complete an internship for the Witch Academy and find out what happened in her supervisor's Manor! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/61635d5252c002d8a5c96d730f0ace75.poster.avif?t=1609063592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/61635d5252c002d8a5c96d730f0ace75.webm?t=1609063592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/61635d5252c002d8a5c96d730f0ace75.mp4?t=1609063592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/beca371a53bc91474fac90bfebe664e9.poster.avif?t=1609063592\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/beca371a53bc91474fac90bfebe664e9.apng?t=1609063592\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>An adventure game with lots of puzzles, a retro feeling, interactive magic and a talking squirrel ghostl!<br>- Many different types of <strong>puzzles</strong>: from escape-rooms to riddles and item combination!<br>- <strong>Magic system</strong>: spells that interact with the enviroment, such as the &quot;Magnet Spell&quot; to move metal objects and the &quot;Light Spell&quot; to light up small fires or turn on lights! Unlock more as you progress with the story!<br>- A lively cast of <strong>crazy characters with original design and personality</strong>!<br>- <strong>Plot full of mystery</strong> with secrets and multiple endings!<br>- Original <strong>artwork</strong> by artist Caterina Capogrossi. <br><br>Inspired by classic point-and-click adventure games and with a cartoon look that's just too cute to resist, &quot;The Button Witch&quot; is an original and polished game for all ages! Don't forget to bring your magic wand!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/120f9e9c2df0a347fc170bed9f982014.poster.avif?t=1609063592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/120f9e9c2df0a347fc170bed9f982014.webm?t=1609063592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/120f9e9c2df0a347fc170bed9f982014.mp4?t=1609063592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You can also find &quot;The Button Witch&quot; bundled with the Digital Soundtrack:<br><br>And the Artbook and Guide:<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/4b93f60d3a96875b7b7e0162f24785fa.poster.avif?t=1609063592\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198270/extras/4b93f60d3a96875b7b7e0162f24785fa.webp?t=1609063592\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
